nod reimplements fx's architecture on Bun and reuses fx's tool names and
schemas, prompts, and user-visible strings (with "fx" renamed to "nod").
Changes from fx: rewritten in TypeScript, only the ChatGPT (Codex) and Grok
subscription backends are kept, and the Vercel AI Gateway, `setup`, `teams`,
and `credits` features are removed.
